size (\code{extract_ancestors()}), narrows each ancestor set down to direct
\strong{parents} (\code{extract_parents()}), and finally tests remaining
parent-free pairs for a shared latent confounder
(\code{extract_vars_sharing_confounders()}). Pairs found to share a latent
confounder are marked \code{NA} in the adjacency matrix rather than estimated.
